# guren

Skills for starting a [Guren](https://guren.dev) app and installing its agent
harness. Part of the `gurenjs` marketplace; see the
[repository README](../../README.md) for install instructions.

- `guren-new-app` — scaffold a Guren app where none exists, then hand off.
- `guren-harness` — install or refresh the app's own harness
  (`bunx guren agent:init` / `agent:sync`) and follow its loop.

Version `__CLI_VERSION__`, generated from `@guren/cli`.
